 ("abigail", 3, ["My husband Nabal was churlish.", "I brought bread, wine and figs to David's men.", "I persuaded David not to shed blood.", "After Nabal died, I became David's wife."], ["Abigail", "Michal", "Bathsheba", "Ahinoam"], "1 Samuel 25:3", ["Abigail", "Nabal"], "The man's name was Nabal and the name of his wife Abigail."),
