 ("jael", 4, ["I was the wife of Heber the Kenite.", "Sisera fled to my tent.", "I gave him milk when he asked for water.", "I drove a nail of the tent into his temples."], ["Jael", "Deborah", "Delilah", "Rahab"], "Judges 4:21", ["Jael", "nail"], "Jael, Heber's wife, took a nail of the tent and smote it into Sisera's temples."),
